{id:"gorillaz",name:"Gorillaz",type:"group",formed:1998,origin:"英国",region:"英国",genres:["Alternative Hip-Hop","Electronic","Pop"],era:"2000s-2020s",influences:["del","de_la_soul"],desc:"Damon Albarn 与漫画家 Jamie Hewlett 的虚拟乐队，2001首张（Del、《Clint Eastwood》稳定慢速）、2005 Demon Days（Danger Mouse、《Feel Good Inc.》）、后来 Plastic Beach/Humanz，用虚拟形象、动画与全球客座（嘻哈/雷鬼/afrobeat）打通流派，是最成功的虚拟音乐项目，连接另类嘻哈与世界音乐。",keyAlbums:["gorillaz_debut","gorillaz_demon","gorillaz_plastic","gorillaz_humanz","gorillaz_cracker"]},
{id:"neptunes",name:"The Neptunes / N.E.R.D",type:"production",formed:1992,origin:"美国/弗吉尼亚海滩",region:"南部",genres:["Hip-Hop","Funk","Pop"],era:"1990s-2020s",influences:["chic","prince"],desc:"Pharrell Williams 与 Chad Hugo，1990末-2000s最具辨识度的制作组合，用干净、太空、放克的合成器与打击乐为Jay-Z、Britney、Snoop、Justin、Kelis 制作金曲；N.E.R.D 是其摇滚/放克个人化乐队（2001 In Search Of...、2004 Fly or Die），Pharrell后来单飞（Happy）、再与Daft Punk，他们重塑了2000年代流行的声音触感。",keyAlbums:["n.e.r.d_in_search","n.e.r.d_fly_or_die","n.e.r.d_seeing","n.e.r.d_no_one"]},
{id:"destinys_child",name:"Destiny's Child",type:"group",formed:1990,origin:"美国/休斯顿",region:"南部",genres:["R&B","Pop"],era:"1990s-2000s",influences:["michael_jackson","whitney_houston"],desc:"Beyoncé、Kelly Rowland、Michelle Williams（早期LeToya/LaTavia），1998首张、1999《The Writing's on the Wall》（《Bills Bills Bills》《Say My Name》、女性独立、复杂和声）、2001 Survivor，她们把女子组合的福音和声、嘻哈节奏与女性自主合一，2005解散后Beyoncé单飞成一代天后，是史上最畅销女子组合，影响TLC之后所有女团。",keyAlbums:["destinys_child_debut","destinys_child_writings","destinys_child_survivor","destinys_child_destiny"]},
{id:"rihanna",name:"Rihanna",type:"person",birth:1988,origin:"巴巴多斯",region:"加勒比",genres:["R&B","Pop","Dancehall"],era:"2000s-2020s",influences:["prince"],desc:"加勒比出道、Jay-Z/Roc Nation，2005 Music of the Sun、2007《Good Girl Gone Bad》（《Umbrella》稳定慢速、转型）、后来 Only Girl/We Found Love、2016 ANTI（《Work》dancehall、《Needed Me》）成为艺术成熟之作，她把dancehall、电子、alt-R&B与时尚/商业帝国（Fenty）合一，是21世纪流行与黑人女性企业家的代表，后来超级碗、与A$AP。",keyAlbums:["rihanna_sun","rihanna_good_girl","rihanna_loud","rihanna_talk","rihanna_anti"]},
{id:"sharon_jones",name:"Sharon Jones & the Dap-Kings",type:"group",formed:1996,origin:"美国/纽约布鲁克林",region:"纽约",genres:["Soul","Funk","Retro-Soul"],era:"2000s-2010s",influences:["aretha_franklin","james_brown"],desc:"复古灵魂复兴（Daptone Records）的核心，Sharon 中年才走红、Dap-Kings 用全模拟、现场、1960年代 Stax/James Brown 的声音，2002 Dap-Dippin'、2007 Naturally、2014 100 Days（她患癌仍巡演、2016去世），他们在数字时代坚持原汁原味的灵魂/放克，后来为Amy Winehouse Back to Black 伴奏，掀起retro-soul浪潮。",keyAlbums:["sharon_jones_dap","sharon_jones_naturally","sharon_jones_100","sharon_jones_soul_time"]},
{id:"jhene",name:"Jhené Aiko",type:"person",birth:1988,origin:"美国/洛杉矶",region:"洛杉矶",genres:["Alt-R&B","Neo-Soul"],era:"2000s-2020s",influences:["sade","lauryn_hill"],desc:"氛围化、空灵、近冥想的alt-R&B女声，2013 Sail Out（《The Worst》）、2014 Souled Out、2020 Chilombo（水晶/声音疗愈），她把Sade式的慵懒、neo-soul的流动与情感疗愈合一，后来与Big Sean、H.E.R.，是氛围alt-R&B的代表，连接新灵魂与治愈系。",keyAlbums:["jhene_sail","jhene_souled","jhene_trip","jhene_chilombo"]}
