{id:"destinys_child_destiny",artist:"destinys_child",title:"Destiny Fulfilled / #1's",year:2004,label:"Columbia",genres:["R&B"],type:"studio",essential:false,producers:["9th Wonder? 关联","Rodney Jerkins"],analysis:"解散前最后录音室专辑，《Lose My Breath》稳定、《Soldier》（T.I./Lil Wayne）稳定，她们回顾情谊，随后#1's 与告别巡演，Beyoncé全面单飞，这张是一个时代女子组合的谢幕记录。",tech:"谢幕、稳定、全明星",recs:["destinys_child_survivor","beyonce_bday"],tracks:["t_dc_lose_my_breath","t_dc_soldier","t_dc_girl","t_dc_cater_2_u","t_dc_is_she_the_reason","t_dc_bad_habit"]},
{id:"rihanna_sun",artist:"rihanna",title:"Music of the Sun / A Girl Like Me（Pon de Replay / SOS）",year:2005,label:"Def Jam",genres:["Dancehall","R&B"],type:"studio",essential:false,producers:["Carl Sturken","Evan Rogers"],analysis:"巴巴多斯出道，《Pon de Replay》稳定dancehall、《SOS》采样Soft T? 稳定，她以加勒比节奏与青春形象起步，后来Good Girl Gone Bad 转型，这两张是其明星起点。它以加勒比 dancehall 节奏出道、青春而明亮，为 Good Girl Gone Bad 的全球转型埋下起点。",tech:"dancehall出道、加勒比、采样",recs:["rihanna_good_girl","rihanna_loud"],tracks:["t_ri_pon_de_replay","t_ri_sos","t_ri_if_its_lovin","t_ri_unfaithful","t_ri_we_ride","t_ri_breakin_dishes"]},
{id:"rihanna_good_girl",artist:"rihanna",title:"Good Girl Gone Bad（Umbrella / Don't Stop the Music / Shut Up and Drive）",year:2007,label:"Def Jam",genres:["Pop","R&B","Dance"],type:"studio",essential:true,producers:["Tricky Stewart","The-Dream","Timbaland","Stargate"],analysis:"她从加勒比青春偶像转型为全球巨星的关键专辑，《Umbrella》（Jay-Z、稳定慢速、“ella ella”、格莱美）成为现象金曲，《Don't Stop the Music》稳定、Michael Jackson 采样，《Shut Up and Drive》、《Rehab》。它把舞曲、流行、R&B与更成熟、更冷的形象合一，后来Only Girl/We Found Love 更电子、ANTI 回归dancehall/alt-R&B，这张是其统治的起点，也让她成为21世纪最成功的黑人女歌手之一。",tech:"转型金曲、电子舞曲、Jay-Z交叉",recs:["rihanna_anti","rihanna_loud"],tracks:["t_ri_umbrella","t_ri_dont_stop_music","t_ri_shut_up_drive","t_ri_rehab","t_ri_hate_that_i_love_u","t_ri_push_up_on_me","t_ri_sell_me_candy","t_ri_good_girl_gone_bad"]},
{id:"rihanna_loud",artist:"rihanna",title:"Loud / Talk That Talk（Only Girl / We Found Love）",year:2010,label:"Def Jam",genres:["Dance","Pop"],type:"studio",essential:false,producers:["Calvin Harris","Stargate"],analysis:"红发、回归明亮舞曲，《Only Girl》稳定、《We Found Love》Calvin Harris 稳定、成为电子时代金曲，《S&M》、Talk That Talk（Jay-Z），她全面拥抱EDM，后来ANTI 转向，这张是其舞曲高峰。",tech:"EDM、明亮舞曲、Calvin Harris",recs:["rihanna_talk","rihanna_good_girl"],tracks:["t_ri_only_girl","t_ri_we_found_love","t_ri_sm","t_ri_whats_my_name","t_ri_cheers","t_ri_you_da_one","t_ri_talk_that_talk"]},
{id:"rihanna_talk",artist:"rihanna",title:"Unapologetic（Diamonds / Stay）",year:2012,label:"Def Jam",genres:["Pop","R&B"],type:"studio",essential:false,producers:["Stargate","Benny Blanco"],analysis:"《Diamonds》稳定慢速、“shine bright”、情感更成熟，《Stay》慢速、与Mikky Ekko，她在EDM之后回到更慢、更私人，为ANTI 的艺术化铺路，这张是其转型过渡之作。它在 EDM 之后回到更慢、更私人的表达，展现成熟情感，为 ANTI 的艺术化铺路。",tech:"慢速成熟、私人、转型",recs:["rihanna_anti","rihanna_loud"],tracks:["t_ri_diamonds","t_ri_stay","t_ri_pour_it_up","t_ri_nobody_business","t_ri_love_without","t_ri_jump_ri"]},
{id:"rihanna_anti",artist:"rihanna",title:"ANTI（Work / Needed Me / Kiss It Better / Love on the Brain）",year:2016,label:"Westbury Road/Roc Nation",genres:["Alt-R&B","Dancehall","Soul"],type:"studio",essential:true,producers:["DJ Mustard","Boi-1da","Hit-Boy"],analysis:"她在商业巅峰后、刻意反潮流的艺术成熟之作，几乎放弃EDM金曲，拥抱dancehall、alt-R&B、1970灵魂与低保真氛围。《Work》（Drake、稳定dancehall、模糊口音）成为冠军，《Needed Me》稳定、《Kiss It Better》慢速、《Love on the Brain》稳定灵魂、《Higher》粗糙短曲。它像一场私人派对、不刻意讨好，却展现她作为完整艺人的深度，后来她专注Fenty商业帝国、超级碗回归，这张是其音乐艺术的高峰。",tech:"反潮流、dancehall/灵魂、低保真",recs:["rihanna_good_girl","sza_sos"],tracks:["t_ri_work","t_ri_needed_me","t_ri_kiss_it_better","t_ri_love_on_brain","t_ri_higher","t_ri_same_ol_mistakes","t_ri_never_end","t_ri_close_to_you"]},
{id:"sharon_jones_dap",artist:"sharon_jones",title:"Dap-Dippin' with Sharon Jones and the Dap-Kings",year:2002,label:"Daptone",genres:["Retro-Soul","Funk"],type:"studio",essential:true,producers:["Bosco Mann (Gabe Roth)"],analysis:"复古灵魂复兴的开山之作，Sharon 做过多年保安与伴唱、中年才走红，Dap-Kings 用全模拟、现场、1960年代 Stax/James Brown 的声音，没有任何数字光泽。《Got a Thing on My Mind》稳定、《What Have You Done for Me Lately》（不是Janet版、慢速），他们在R&B全面电子化时，原汁原味地复活深南方灵魂/放克，后来为Amy Winehouse Back to Black 伴奏、掀起全球retro-soul，这张是Daptone 美学与Sharon 巨星身份的原点。",tech:"全模拟现场、1960s Stax音色、复古复兴",recs:["sharon_jones_naturally","sharon_jones_100"],tracks:["t_sj_got_thing","t_sj_what_have_u_done","t_sj_cut_that_line","t_sj_dap_dippin","t_sj_gonna_make_time","t_sj_aint_no_chimneys","t_sj_longer_worse"]},
{id:"sharon_jones_naturally",artist:"sharon_jones",title:"Naturally / 100 Days, 100 Nights",year:2007,label:"Daptone",genres:["Soul","Funk"],type:"studio",essential:false,producers:["Bosco Mann"],analysis:"《How Long Do I Have to Wait》稳定、《100 Days, 100 Nights》稳定、福音式 lead 更成熟，她与乐队把复古灵魂做到现场巅峰，后来患癌仍巡演，这张是其黄金期稳定高峰。它把复古灵魂做到现场巅峰、福音式 lead 更醇厚，是 Daptone 黄金期的稳定高峰。",tech:"现场巅峰、福音lead、复古",recs:["sharon_jones_100","sharon_jones_soul_time"],tracks:["t_sj_how_long_wait","t_sj_100_days","t_sj_nobody_s_baby","t_sj_keep_on_looking","t_sj_thing_keeps_my_chain","t_sj_humble_me"]},
{id:"sharon_jones_100",artist:"sharon_jones",title:"I Learned the Hard Way / Give the People What They Want",year:2010,label:"Daptone",genres:["Soul"],type:"studio",essential:false,producers:["Bosco Mann"],analysis:"更细腻、成熟的灵魂，《I Learned the Hard Way》慢速、她把人生教训唱得醇厚，后来确诊癌症、Give the People 更欢快，她坚持现场，这张是其艺术稳定期之作。它以更细腻成熟的灵魂讲述人生教训，她在确诊前后仍坚持现场，展示音乐的坚韧。",tech:"醇厚慢速、人生教训、现场",recs:["sharon_jones_naturally","sharon_jones_soul_time"],tracks:["t_sj_learned_hard_way","t_sj_better_than_nothing","t_sj_give_people","t_sj_retreat","t_sj_people_dont_get","t_sj_youll_be_lonely"]},
{id:"sharon_jones_soul_time",artist:"sharon_jones",title:"Soul of a Woman（身后发行）",year:2017,label:"Daptone",genres:["Soul","Gospel"],type:"studio",essential:false,producers:["Bosco Mann"],analysis:"她2016年因癌症去世后的最后录音，《Matter of Time》慢速、《Sail On!》福音收尾，她在病痛中仍唱出饱满的灵魂与坚韧，是一位伟大歌手的生命绝唱与Daptone 精神的总结。它作为身后发行的生命绝唱，在病痛中仍唱出饱满灵魂与福音，为 Daptone 精神作结。",tech:"身后发行、福音收尾、生命绝唱",recs:["sharon_jones_dap","sharon_jones_naturally"],tracks:["t_sj_matter_of_time","t_sj_sail_on","t_sj_rumble_in_jungle","t_sj_just_call","t_sj_searchin_for_a_new_day","t_sj_girl_you_cant_win"]},
{id:"jhene_sail",artist:"jhene",title:"Sail Out（The Worst / Bed Peace）",year:2013,label:"Def Jam/ARTium",genres:["Alt-R&B"],type:"studio",essential:false,producers:["Fisticuffs"],analysis:"她的突破EP，《The Worst》稳定慢速、把关系中的自毁唱成金曲，《Bed Peace》（Childish Gambino）慢速、慵懒，她空灵近耳语的 lead 延续Sade式氛围，为Souled Out 铺路，是alt-R&B氛围派的起点。",tech:"空灵耳语、慵懒慢速、氛围",recs:["jhene_souled","jhene_chilombo"],tracks:["t_jh_the_worst","t_jh_bed_peace","t_jh_316","t_jh_stranger","t_jh_drinking_smoking","t_jh_comfort_inn"]},
{id:"jhene_souled",artist:"jhene",title:"Souled Out（To Love & Die / W.A.Y.S.）",year:2014,label:"Def Jam/ARTium",genres:["Alt-R&B","Neo-Soul"],type:"studio",essential:false,producers:["Fisticuffs"],analysis:"正式出道、延续空灵与冥想，《To Love & Die》稳定、《W.A.Y.S.》慢速，她把灵性、治愈与关系焦虑包进水波般的制作，后来Trip/Chilombo，这张是其氛围美学的完整呈现。它以水波般的制作完整呈现空灵与灵性，把关系焦虑与自我疗愈做成氛围体验。",tech:"水波制作、灵性治愈、空灵",recs:["jhene_trip","jhene_sail"],tracks:["t_jh_to_love_die","t_jh_ways","t_jh_promises","t_jh_lyin_king","t_jh_spotless_mind","t_jh_blue_dream","t_jh_beautiful_ruin"]},
{id:"jhene_trip",artist:"jhene",title:"Trip（Sativa / Never Call Me）",year:2017,label:"Def Jam",genres:["Alt-R&B"],type:"studio",essential:false,producers:["Fisticuffs","No I.D."],analysis:"围绕丧兄、药物与自我疗愈的概念，《Sativa》（Rae Sremmurd的Swae Lee）稳定、《Never Call Me》稳定，她把 grief 与成长做成氛围旅程，后来Chilombo 更冥想，这张是其情感深化之作。",tech:"丧兄疗愈、氛围旅程、Swae",recs:["jhene_chilombo","jhene_souled"],tracks:["t_jh_sativa","t_jh_never_call_me","t_jh_trip_song","t_jh_overstimulated","t_jh_bad_trip","t_jh_never_broke","t_jh_mystery_of_love"]},
{id:"jhene_chilombo",artist:"jhene",title:"Chilombo（Pussy Fairy / Happiness Over Everything）",year:2020,label:"Def Jam",genres:["Alt-R&B","Neo-Soul"],type:"studio",essential:false,producers:["Fisticuffs","Kehlani? 关联"],analysis:"在夏威夷录制、用水晶唱钵与自然声做声音疗愈，《Pussy Fairy》稳定慢速、《H.O.E.》、与Future/John Legend，她把冥想、身体与自我和解合一，是其氛围/治愈美学的成熟高峰。它以水晶唱钵与自然声做声音疗愈，把冥想、身体与和解合一，是其治愈美学高峰。",tech:"水晶唱钵、声音疗愈、自然声",recs:["jhene_trip","sza_ctrl"],tracks:["t_jh_pussy_fairy","t_jh_hoe","t_jh_born_tired","t_jh_lightning_jh","t_jh_10k_hours","t_jh_speaking_of","t_jh_ad_ut"]}
